  "disposition": "confirmed-nonfatal-page-summary-defect",
  "finding": "The page summary incorrectly calls the family X^lambda T_w an A-basis; the current local theorem states the R_0-basis. As an A-family, 1 and X_1 have the nontrivial A-linear relation X_1*1-1*X_1=0.",
